intelligence has become an es","content":"Artificial intelligence has become an essential tool for professionals, creatives, and curious minds\nalike. With models like GPT-5, Claude, Gemini, and Grok now available through platforms like Hustlrr,\ngetting started has never been easier.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":776.5,"x":336,"y":384.19},{"type":"text","id":"t2fo","name":"What Are AI Models?","content":"What Are AI Models?","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":510.58},{"type":"text","id":"t2fp","name":"AI models are sophisticated systems trai","content":"AI models are sophisticated systems trained on vast amounts of text data. They can understand\ncontext, generate human-like responses, and assist with a wide range of tasks — from writing and\nanalysis to coding and research.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":776.5,"x":336,"y":555.38},{"type":"text","id":"t2fq","name":"Choosing the Right Model","content":"Choosing the Right Model","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":681.77},{"type":"text","id":"t2fr","name":"Each AI model has its strengths:","content":"Each AI model has its strengths:","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":726.57},{"type":"text","id":"t2fs","name":"GPT-5","content":"GPT-5","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-600","lineHeight":"$lineHeig