:"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":384.19},{"type":"text","id":"t2ry","name":"As a developer who’s built a few AI-powe","content":"As a developer who’s built a few AI-powered apps, I’ve seen countless entrepreneurs invest months—sometimes\nyears—into ideas that never pan out. The risk is real, and the cost of failure can be\ndevastating.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":776.5,"x":336,"y":428.99},{"type":"text","id":"t2rz","name":"But what if there was a way to test your","content":"But what if there was a way to test your idea quickly, cheaply, and with minimal risk? Enter AI.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":535.38},{"type":"text","id":"t2s0","name":"AI tools like GPT, Claude, and Gemini ar","content":"AI tools like GPT, Claude, and Gemini are increasingly being used by founders to validate their\nbusiness concepts before diving in headfirst. These tools can help you identify flaws, assess market\ndemand, and even draft your first product roadmap—all in a matter of minutes.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":776.5,"x":336,"y":584.18},{"type":"text","id":"t2s1","name":"Why Idea Validation Matters","content":"Why Idea Validation Matters","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":710.57},{"type":"text","id":"t2s2","name":"Before you invest your time, energy, and","content":"Before you invest your time, energy, and money into a business idea, it’s crucial to validate it. This\nmeans answering questions like:","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":776.5,"x":336,"y":755.37},{"type":"text","id":"t2s3","name":"Is there a real demand for this?","content":"Is there a real demand for this?","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":360,"y":832.96},{"type":"text","id":"t2s4","name":"Who would actually use it?","content":"Who would actually use it?","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":360,"y":869.76},{"type":"text","id":"t2s5","name":"What are the potential competitors?","content":"What are the potential competitors?","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":360,"y":906.55},{"type":"text","id":"t2s6","name":"What are the main pain points it solves?","content":"What are the main pain points it solves?","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":360,"y":943.35},{"type":"text","id":"t2s7","name":"Traditionally, this would involve market","content":"Traditionally, this would involve market research, customer interviews, and prototyping—time-consuming\nand expensive processes. AI tools are changing that.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":776.5,"x":336,"y":992.15},{"type":"text","id":"t2s8","name":"How AI Tools Can Help","content":"How AI Tools Can Help","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":1089.74},{"type":"text","id":"t2s9","name":"AI tools like GPT, Claude, and Gemini ca","content":"AI tools like GPT, Claude, and Gemini can act as your first line of defense. They can help you:","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":1134.54},{"type":"text","id":"t2sa","name":"Identify gaps in your idea","content":"Identify gaps in your idea","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":360,"y":1183.33},{"type":"text","id":"t2sb","name":"Generate potential user personas","content":"Generate potential user personas","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":360,"y":1220.13},{"type":"text","id":"t2sc","name":"Draft a basic business model","content":"Draft a basic business model","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":360,"y":1256.93},{"type":"text","id":"t2sd","name":"Analyze competitors","content":"Analyze competitors","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":360,"y":1293.72},{"type":"text","id":"t2se","name":"Test product names or taglines","content":"Test product names or taglines","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":360,"y":1330.52},{"type":"text","id":"t2sf","name":"In one Reddit post, a developer shared h","content":"In one Reddit post, a developer shared how he used GPT, Claude, and Gemini to evaluate the same\nidea. The results were surprisingly consistent—each AI tool highlighted similar strengths and\nweaknesses, giving him confidence in his idea’s viability.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":776.5,"x":336,"y":1379.32},{"type":"text","id":"t2sg","name":"Here’s a quick breakdown of how each too","content":"Here’s a quick breakdown of how each tool can help:","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":1485.71},{"type":"text","id":"t2sh","name":"GPT","content":"GPT","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-600","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":1546.51},{"type":"text","id":"t2si","name":"GPT is great for brainstorming, outlinin","content":"GPT is great for brainstorming, outlining, and writing. It can help you write a compelling pitch deck,\ndraft a product description, or even simulate a customer interview.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":776.5,"x":336,"y":1587.3},{"type":"text","id":"t2sj","name":"Claude","content":"Claude","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-600","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":1676.9},{"type":"text","id":"t2sk","name":"Claude excels at reasoning and complex a","content":"Claude excels at reasoning and complex analysis. It’s particularly useful for evaluating business\nmodels, identifying risks, and structuring detailed reports.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":776.5,"x":336,"y":1717.69},{"type":"text","id":"t2sl","name":"Gemini","content":"Gemini","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-600","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":1807.29},{"type":"text","id":"t2sm","name":"Gemini is powerful for data analysis and","content":"Gemini is powerful for data analysis and synthesis. It can help you compare market trends, analyze\npricing strategies, and even generate visual summaries.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":776.5,"x":336,"y":1848.08},{"type":"text","id":"t2sn","name":"Real-World Example","content":"Real-World Example","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":1945.68},{"type":"text","id":"t2so","name":"Let’s say you’re thinking about building","content":"Let’s say you’re thinking about building a productivity app for remote workers. You’ve got a basic idea,\nbut you want to make sure it’s worth pursuing.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":776.5,"x":336,"y":1990.48},{"type":"text","id":"t2sp","name":"Here’s how you might use AI tools to val","content":"Here’s how you might use AI tools to validate it:","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":2068.07},{"type":"text","id":"t2sq","name":"Define the problem","content":"Define the problem","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-600","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":360,"y":2116.87},{"type":"text","id":"t2sr","name":": Ask GPT to help you articulate the cor","content":": Ask GPT to help you articulate the core problem remote workers face.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":506.48,"y":2116.87},{"type":"text","id":"t2ss","name":"Identify the audience","content":"Identify the audience","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-600","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":360,"y":2153.66},{"type":"text","id":"t2st","name":": Use Claude to draft potential user per","content":": Use Claude to draft potential user personas.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":522.11,"y":2153.66},{"type":"text","id":"t2su","name":"Analyze competitors","content":"Analyze competitors","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-600","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":360,"y":2190.46},{"type":"text","id":"t2sv","name":": Ask Gemini to summarize existing tools","content":": Ask Gemini to summarize existing tools in the space.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":518.59,"y":2190.46},{"type":"text","id":"t2sw","name":"Test the concept","content":"Test the concept","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-600","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":360,"y":2227.26},{"type":"text","id":"t2sx","name":": Have GPT draft a simple landing page c","content":": Have GPT draft a simple landing page copy or a pitch.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":488.58,"y":2227.26},{"type":"text","id":"t2sy","name":"By doing this, you’re not only saving ti","content":"By doing this, you’re not only saving time and money, but also gaining clarity on whether your idea is\nworth pursuing.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":776.5,"x":336,"y":2276.05},{"type":"text","id":"t2sz","name":"How Hustlrr.ai Fits In","content":"How Hustlrr.ai Fits In","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":2373.65},{"type":"text","id":"t2t0","name":"While AI tools are powerful, they can so","content":"While AI tools are powerful, they can sometimes feel scattered. You’re switching between tools,\ncopying and pasting, trying to piece together insights.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":776.5,"x":336,"y":2418.44},{"type":"text","id":"t2t1","name":"This is where Hustlrr.ai comes in. It’s ","content":"This is where Hustlrr.ai comes in. It’s designed to help you streamline your idea validation process by\nintegrating the best of AI tools into a single, easy-to-use interface. You can ask Hustlrr to evaluate\nyour idea, generate a report, and even suggest next steps—all without leaving the app.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":776.5,"x":336,"y":2496.04},{"type":"text","id":"t2t2","name":"It’s not about replacing AI tools, but a","content":"It’s not about replacing AI tools, but about making them work better together.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":2602.43},{"type":"text","id":"t2t3","name":"Final Thoughts","content":"Final Thoughts","fill":"$text-primary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":2671.23},{"type":"text","id":"t2t4","name":"AI is not a magic bullet, but it’s a pow","content":"AI is not a magic bullet, but it’s a powerful ally in the early stages of your startup journey. It can help\nyou avoid costly mistakes, gain clarity, and speed up the validation process.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":776.5,"x":336,"y":2716.02},{"type":"text","id":"t2t5","name":"If you’re thinking about launching a new","content":"If you’re thinking about launching a new idea, don’t skip the validation step. Use AI tools to test your\nassumptions and get feedback before you invest everything.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":776.5,"x":336,"y":2793.62},{"type":"text","id":"t2t6","name":"And if you want to make that process eve","content":"And if you want to make that process even easier, try Hustlrr.ai. It’s built for founders who want to\nvalidate fast and move forward with confidence.","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":776.5,"x":336,"y":2871.21},{"type":"text","id":"t2t7","name":"👉","content":"👉","fill":"$text-secondary","fontFamily":"$font-inter-16","fontSize":"$fontSize-base","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_8","x":336,"y":2948.8},{"type":"text","id":"t2t8","name":"Start validating your ideas with Hustlrr","content":"Start validating your ideas with Hustlrr.ai","fill":"$accent","fontFamily":"$font-in